WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.344
Welcome to Orbit. Stories in progress. Our focus is Past Continuous.

2
00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:16.257
Use was or were plus the ing form for an action in progress at a past time. A short past simple event can interrupt it.

3
00:00:16.257 --> 00:00:19.036
What were you doing at eight yesterday?

4
00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:22.105
It started to rain while we were walking.

5
00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.219
I was walking home when I heard a noise.

6
00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:34.617
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
